        {
          "text": " kandi yuko abanyamahanga bo mu gihugu nibazana ibintu cyangwa ibyokurya byose kugura ku munsi w'isabato, tutazagura na bo ku munsi w'isabato cyangwa ku munsi mukuru, kandi yuko umwaka wa karindwi tuzaraza igihugu ihinga, tukarorera no kwishyuza umwenda wose.",
